        "privacy": "Capture is opt-in: RAPP Rewind requests its own Screen Recording grant only after Start and never records automatically at launch or login. ScreenCaptureKit capture, Vision OCR, fingerprints, SQLite indexing, and search stay on this Mac; no audio is captured and this processing path makes no network upload. Images, OCR text, and the index remain in ~/.rapprewind or an explicit REWIND_HOME. Visible content can include passwords and private messages; configure and save bundle-ID/window-title exclusions or pause before sensitive work. Rewind does not encrypt its files; protect the account and use FileVault. Image retention is off until enabled, and pruning keeps indexed text. Background operation and idle-at-login launch are separate explicit opt-ins. The optional RAPP host conversation may forward text returned by its agent to that host's LLM; use the native app or direct CLI when that conversation is not appropriate.",
